  "about": "Which builder-visible R records state each scenario rule (BILL-*), per release, with each record's role (roles and conditions as defined in skills/redwood-r-generator/SKILL.md; the condition is computed from the roles). Every rule a scenario in tests/data/billing_scenarios.json names has an entry for that scenario's release, and R0 rules also have an R1 entry because Q10 replays them on R1. A release lists every record visible in it, so R1 entries may cite R0 paths. Expected answers must be derivable from these records; the S spec that generated R is not a source. This file stays with the verifier.",
